<title>USA: Polo Ralph Lauren indicated at $34 to $36.</title>
<headline>Polo Ralph Lauren indicated at $34 to $36.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of fashion designer Polo Ralph Lauren Corp were indicated sharply higher ahead of their opening on the New York Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shares, which priced at $26 each, were first indicated at $31 to $34 on the Big Board but moved even higher, to an indication of $34 to $36.  </p>
<p>((Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1881))</p>
